{"step_index":90,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-19T23:17:57Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-20T04:47:57+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-09-20T04:48:01+05:30\nThe search for \"apple.com/in-edu/shop MacBook Air 15 M4 16GB 512GB direct product link buy education India\" returned the following summary:\nTo purchase a MacBook Air with education savings in India, you can visit the official Apple Education Store at [apple.com/in-edu/shop](https://www.apple.com/in-edu/shop).\n\n### How to Buy via Apple Education Store:\n1.  **Visit the Portal:** Go to the [Apple Education Store (India)](https://www.apple.com/in-edu/shop) to view eligible products and pricing.\n2.  **Verify Eligibility:** Education pricing is available to current college students, students accepted to college, parents buying for students, and educators or staff at all levels. You may be required to verify your status via UNiDAYS.\n3.  **Select Your Model:** Once on the site, navigate to the **Mac** section to select the **MacBook Air** model that meets your requirements (e.g., 15-inch, M4 chip, 16GB RAM, 512GB SSD).\n4.  **Customize and Add to Bag:** You can configure the unified memory and storage options directly on the product page before adding them to your cart.\n\n### Key Information Regarding the MacBook Air (M4):\n*   **Availability:** As of September 2026, the MacBook Air 15-inch with the M4 chip is available in the Indian market.\n*   **Education Pricing:** Purchasing through the Apple Education Store typically offers savings compared to standard retail prices. Additionally, Apple often runs \"Back to School\" promotions that may include extra benefits (such as gift cards or discounts on accessories) for qualified purchasers.\n*   **Support:** If you need assistance with your purchase, you can call Apple Support at **000800 040 1966** or use the chat feature available on the Apple Store website to speak with a Mac Specialist."}
{"step_index":91,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-19T23:18:01Z","content":"Here are your direct links:\n\n## Direct Links — Apple Education Store India:\n\n**Step 1 — Open this link:**\n👉 [**apple.com/in-edu/shop/buy-mac/macbook-air**](https://www.apple.com/in-edu/shop/buy-mac/macbook-air)\n\n**Step 2 — On that page:**\n- Select **\"MacBook Air 15-inch\"**\n- Select **M4 chip**\n- Select **16GB / 512GB**\n- Select **Sky Blue** colour\n- Click **\"Add to Bag\"**\n\nThat's it. Education prices will already be shown (lower than normal store).\n\n---\n\n## If UNiDAYS verification pops up:\n- Use your **college email** (fastest), OR\n- Upload **college ID card photo** (takes 24-48 hrs)\n\n## If you're stuck or can't find the product:\n📞 Call Apple India: **000 800 040 1966** (free call)\nTell them: *\"I'm a student, I want to buy MacBook Air 15 inch M4 16GB 512GB with education pricing\"*\nThey'll walk you through it or place the order for you over the phone."}
